        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Human Form: When Elise's abilities hit an enemy, she gains a dormant Spiderling.<br><br>Spider Form: Basic attacks deal bonus magic damage and restore health to Elise.",
        "bodyHtml": "Elise begins the game with a point in her Ultimate, allowing her to shapeshift between <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Human Form</span> and <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spider Form</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Human Form:</span> Elise's Ability hits grant her a dormant <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spiderling</span>, up to .<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spider Form:</span> Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\"> magic damage</span> and restore <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\"> Health</span>.",
